# Style Gate — Mandatory Two-Turn Protocol

Applies to **all agents** (desktop, mobile, cloud) when user uploads a **new scene** for Teo/Kai/virtual-couple/换脸/小红书.

**Exception — pose-series:** If the input is an already-approved character still and the user wants 系列/换姿态, follow `.cursor/skills/pose-series/SKILL.md`.

**Exception — text-scene:** If there is **no scene photo** and the user gave a **text** brief, do **not** use the clothing template below. Follow `.cursor/skills/text-scene/SKILL.md`: post the filled scene card and STOP.

**Exception — tagame-anime:** @Tagame / `characters/Tagame` / `docs/anime.md` → follow `.cursor/skills/tagame-anime/SKILL.md`. If the user gave Japanese/English lines or said 生成/出图 and has **no scene still**, GenerateImage from the Tagame face ref (scene matches the lines) — do **not** STOP on a scene card. Only post the scene card and STOP when they @Tagame with no lines and no generate request. After the still: if lines exist, skip options and write 10s i2v. Otherwise read the still, post 5 diverse dialogue options, STOP. Never photoreal. Never Teo/Kai clothing template.

**Exception — cover-collage:** 拼接 / 封面图 / 九宫格 / 拼图 / 首页封面 → follow `.cursor/skills/cover-collage/SKILL.md`. Post 3 layout+copy schemes and STOP. Do **not** call GenerateImage (Pillow composite only).

**Exception — wallpaper-demo:** 壁纸演示图 / 锁屏展示 / 锁屏效果图 / 手机锁屏壁纸展示 → follow `.cursor/skills/wallpaper-demo/SKILL.md`. Do **not** post clothing options and do **not** wait. One still in; one iPhone lock-screen product shot out. Brand text only if the user supplied it.

## Turn 1: ASK ONLY — never generate

If the user has **not** replied with customization choices in this conversation:

1. Analyze the scene
2. Post numbered text options (accessories, top color, top pattern, bottom color) per character
3. End with: `⏸️ 请回复后我再生成图片。`
4. **STOP — do not call GenerateImage in this turn**

## Turn 2: Generate only after user reply

Call GenerateImage **only after** user replies with numbers/text, or if their **first message** already said e.g. `全部保持原场景` or `角色默认，上衣藏青`.

